2026-07-12 — WASM plugin isolated smoke test (Linux/amd64)

Environment: Linux/amd64, Go 1.26+, build tag `wasmplugins`.

Command:
  go build -tags 'wasmplugins' -o ./jul-wasm ./cmd/jul
  ./jul-wasm -config testdata/plugins.toml

Load pattern:
  300s loop hitting http://127.0.0.1:8083/ and http://127.0.0.1:8083/blocked
  while observing the `X-Plugin: header-inject` response header on `/`.

Result:
  success=286 errors=0
  The plugin runtime loaded successfully and the `header-inject` plugin emitted the expected response header on every successful request.
